Wed Sep 23 10:32:01 UTC 2026 - Johannes Meixner <jsmeix@suse.com>

- disable-universal-cups-filter : do not use a single, universal
  CUPS filter executable for all filter functions, see
  https://github.com/OpenPrinting/cups-filters/discussions/727
  which reads (excerpts)
  "drivers with ... filter chains ... made universal fail ... 
   2 filters ... which come from ... driver package, but
   universal only supports ... one single driver filter"

